[{:adr/authoritative_for ["genko doc の永続化正本は kotobase.net datomic api:\n    work-actor 鍵由来 graph kotobase/db/<did:key>/genko に\n    {:db/id \"gh.genko/doc/<slug>\" :gh.genko/slug :gh.genko/docB64\n    (base64 必須 — tx_edn パーサが値中の {} でエンティティ分割するため、\n    :atproto.record/jsonB64 と同じ回避) :gh.genko/rev :gh.genko/updatedAt}\n    を単一 string datom で upsert。ストロークの深い datom 化はしない" "localStorage (mangaka-aozora-genko-<slug>) はオフラインキャッシュに降格\n    (write-through 維持 — ストーリーボードへ反映の契約不変)。\n    読込フォールバック: kotobase → localStorage(移行元)→ 新規 doc" "競合規約: save 前に remote rev 再読、remote > base は黙って上書きせず\n    UI で 再読込/上書き(上書きは observed-remote+1)。鍵なしは :local-only、\n    通信失敗は :offline で次回再試行" "kotobase.net apex の edge-CACAO 要求形状(実測 2026-07-09):\n    kotoba://can/kotobase:pin + issuer DID と同値の kotoba://graph/ scope +\n    x-kotoba-did ヘッダ + fresh nonce/リクエスト。kotobase.client 既製 mint は\n    401 になる(client 本体への反映は follow-up)" "実測: 2026-07-02 の transact 500 (Invalid array buffer length) は再現せず。\n    q(datalog) は実在データに空 rows を返すため読出は :eavt datoms scan\n    (server 側要調査)。再 assert は蓄積(cardinality-one 未導入)で\n    reader は log 順 last-wins fold"], :adr/supersedes [], :adr/superseded_by [], :adr/topic "genko-kotobase-persistence", :adr/related ["90-docs/adr/2607091300-genko-editor-rewire-effectlines-gaze.md" "90-docs/adr/2607020200-mangaka-genko-cljc.md" "90-docs/adr/2607070400-app-aozora-manga-work-actor-profiles.md"], :adr/status "accepted", :adr/id "adr-2607091800-genko-kotobase-datomic-persistence", :adr/doc_type "adr", :adr/last_verified "2026-07-09", :adr/decision "{:schema {:graph \"kotobase/db/<did:key>/genko\", :entity {:db/id \"gh.genko/doc/<slug>\", :gh.genko/slug \"<slug>\", :gh.genko/docB64 \"base64(write-doc JSON)\", :gh.genko/rev \"monotonic int\", :gh.genko/updatedAt \"ms\"}}, :landed {:app-aozora \"ab2192365aff5981031fe3bb8e9cad91b975db47\", :west-pin \"afee7c2702f0fb838763402296c7b1766ff554cf\"}, :tests \"228 tests / 624 assertions green; release build 0 warnings;\\n          E2E: localStorage 